Routing(路由) 决定数据应该走哪条路径
Forwarding（转发）：路由器已经知道下一步该往哪里走，然后真正把数据包从某个接口发出去。
IP Address --> Routing --> Packet Forwarding

IP (Internet Protocol)
-IP allows for the fragmentation(碎片化) of large packets into smaller fragments when traversing networks with
varying Maximum Transsmition Unit (MTU) sizes. The receiveng host reassembles these fragments to resconstruct 
the original packet.

ICMP (Internet Control Message Protocol)
-Is closely associated with IP and is used for error reporting and diagnostics. Common ICMP messages include 
echo request and echo reply. (ping)

TCP is a connection-oriented protocol that means TCP establishes(建立) a connection between the sender and receiver before any data is exchanged,
and UDP(User Datagram Protocol) is a connectionless protocol, UDP is faster than TCP but providing no guarantees(不提供任何保证)
regarding(关于) the order or reliability(可靠性) of data delivery. (数据传输)

Why TCP is reliable?
TCP guarantees reliable of data's delivery because one of his primary mechanism is Acknowledgements (Ack) and retransmission of lost packets, 
that means if the segment of data is not Ack, TCP will automatically resents the segments. (Lost packets)
Furthermore, TCP ensures if the packets and datas is delivered in correct order. TCP will re-order all packets before pass them to the higher layer.

TCP works over IP.

TCP  3-Way Hand-shake (TCP三次握手)
It must be mutual akcnowledgement before anything is transfered.

SYN (Synchronize)
Client -> SYN -> Server Intention to stablish the connection, ISN (Initial Sequence Number)
Server -> SYN+ACK -> Client
Client -> ACK -> Server

From the CLient side:
Establishing a connection
SYN (set): Initiates a connection request
ACK (clear): No acknowledgement yet
FIN (clear): No termination request

Establishing a connection (Response)
SYN (set): Acknowledges the connection request
ACK (set): Acknowledges the received data
FIN (clear): No termination yet

Terminating a connection
SYN (clear): No connection request
ACK (set): Acknowledges the received data
FIN (set): The process is terminated
